  // Screen 11 - Settings (GDD §11). Rects are mockup pixels on 11-settings.png.
  // Shared kit for the background, header discs, avatar, title divider (a diamond and one line sprite,
  // mirrored on the left), panel, buttons, every icon and every control (UI/Controls: the toggles' ON
  // and OFF looks in one box, the slider's track, fill and knob, the language dropdown with its
  // chevron). Nothing is cut from the mockup; the thin lines are drawn shapes in their measured
  // colours. Control rects are the Controls kit map's (ArtSource/Kit/Controls.map.csv); the four
  // toggles share one size (83.3 x 47.2) about their own centres. VolumeSlider is the knob's travel:
  // from the track's left end, scaled so that 70% puts the knob where the mockup draws it.
  "name": "Settings",
  "mockup": "11-settings.png",
  "background": "shared",
